      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. It covers the basics. \n\nActually, looking at the output, the completeness metric flagged this as \"critically low\" (the word count is way under our standard threshold for these guides). I know I said not to pad it, but we really need more meat on the bones so it passes the automated check. \n\nCan you expand this? Maybe add some more context on why we use these specific commands, a bit more detail on the prerequisites, or even some \"Best Practices\" for the devs to follow? Just try to make it more substantive so it actually registers as a \"complete\" guide in the system.",
